Recommended Additional Common Sensors
Here are other sensors worth considering for future expansion:

SHT3x / SHT4x (Sensirion) — Very high accuracy temperature + humidity
SCD30 / SCD41 (Sensirion) — Excellent CO₂ sensor (very useful for chamber air quality)
BME688 — Newer version of BME680 with better AI-based gas detection
CCS811 — Older but still common VOC sensor (less accurate than SGP40)
AHT20 or AHT25 — Low-cost, decent temp/humidity sensor
